          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Sound Waves: Characteristics and Applications"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.857,
            0.018,
            0.952,
            0.088
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "N 203"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.088,
            0.359,
            0.309
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Humans have adapted the same principle in underwater exploration through sonar (sound navigation and ranging). In sonar, ultrasonic waves are sent into water and the reflected waves are analysed to determine the distance, direction, and speed of underwater objects, such as submarines or shipwrecks (Fig. 10.28)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.368,
            0.087,
            0.841,
            0.286
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.368,
                0.087,
                0.841,
                0.286
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_19_image_3.jpg",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.502,
                0.292,
                0.732,
                0.308
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 10.28: Functioning of sonar"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.314,
            0.774,
            0.371
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 10.6:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " A naval sonar signal sent into seawater returns after 0.90 s. The speed of sound in seawater is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 5 3 0 \\; \\mathrm { m \\; s ^ { - 1 } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . How far is the object? "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Answer:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Time taken for the signal to reach the object and travel back = 0.90 s"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.14,
            0.37,
            0.732,
            0.405
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Time taken to reach the object is half of above time "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{0.90    s }{2} = 0.45    s"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.14,
            0.406,
            0.675,
            0.425
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Thus, distance = speed × time = 1530 m s"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "–1",
              "styles": [
                "superscript"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " × 0.45 s = 688.5 m"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.426,
            0.172,
            0.479
          ],
          "content": [
